{"4105360": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "The Lucky Hive", "steam_appid": 4105360, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Slug Poker!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4105360/extras/b024cfaccfedbf20f505571cdb0a5995.poster.avif?t=1782764840\" width=800 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4105360/extras/b024cfaccfedbf20f505571cdb0a5995.webm?t=1782764840\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4105360/extras/b024cfaccfedbf20f505571cdb0a5995.mp4?t=1782764840\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Lucky Hive is a poker game about playing with your friends and having fun. It's also about staying clear of the Broodmother...</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy the wonderful game of poker with your friends, playing as colourful characters that represent different aspects of what goes on within the Hive. It's all about relaxing (or getting really, really competitive) with your friends and to try win the biggest hands through all sorts of strategies available to you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Win The Biggest Hand!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4105360/extras/714b60c746ccd7f9482ef80ef0f32bd3.poster.avif?t=1782764840\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4105360/extras/714b60c746ccd7f9482ef80ef0f32bd3.webm?t=1782764840\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4105360/extras/714b60c746ccd7f9482ef80ef0f32bd3.mp4?t=1782764840\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use bluffing to your advantage to win the biggest hand, or overplay your bets to deceive your opponents! Every tactic is fair game in the Hive...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Great For Beginners and Long-Time Players Alike</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Poker can be a daunting game, with hand strengths, side pots and vast nomenclature (what is a flop and who the hell is Under the Gun?), so The Lucky Hive provides a fantastic way for you to experience the amazing game of poker without being thrown into the deep end.<strong> No microtransactions, no real money, just an incredible card game to relax and enjoy!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Single-player &amp; Multiplayer</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4105360/extras/7e40488d5fc6c82ef43acfd6a078d43f.poster.avif?t=1782764840\" width=800 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4105360/extras/7e40488d5fc6c82ef43acfd6a078d43f.webm?t=1782764840\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4105360/extras/7e40488d5fc6c82ef43acfd6a078d43f.mp4?t=1782764840\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Lucky Hive supports up to 6-player lobbies, but also has AI characters you can verse for a single-player experience (plane, trains and automobiles). </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Play as Different Members of the Hive!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Hive has 7 distinct characters, each with their own personalities. Play as any one of them, expressing your attitude within.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4105360/extras/4aa1619c0d204daf197a41619a0778d2.poster.avif?t=1782764840\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4105360/extras/4aa1619c0d204daf197a41619a0778d2.webm?t=1782764840\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4105360/extras/4aa1619c0d204daf197a41619a0778d2.mp4?t=1782764840\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Wishlist Now!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4105360/extras/952f991ba6de93b137754a61d80f813d.poster.avif?t=1782764840\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4105360/extras/952f991ba6de93b137754a61d80f813d.webm?t=1782764840\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4105360/extras/952f991ba6de93b137754a61d80f813d.mp4?t=1782764840\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Lucky Hive is available for wishlisting! We'll be announcing our release date soon (by mid 2026) and unveiling more mechanics as we develop them! Thank you for wishlisting our first game!</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Slug Poker!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4105360/extras/b024cfaccfedbf20f505571cdb0a5995.poster.avif?t=1782764840\" width=800 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_a